---
import Atmosphere from "./Atmosphere.astro";
import Button from './Button.astro';
interface Props { full?: boolean }
const {full = false} = Astro.props;
---
<section class="section vision" id="future-vision"><Atmosphere variant="arena" /><div class="container split"><div class="stack"><h2>BEYOND<br />THE <span class="crimson">LIMITS.</span></h2><p>Our future vision is clear: represent Singapore on the M-Series stage and pursue a place among the international top three.</p><p>Every practice, every lesson, every step forward brings that ambition into focus.</p>{!full && <Button href="/profile/#future-vision" secondary>Explore our vision</Button>}</div><div class="goals"><article class="goal"><div><span>OUR AMBITION · GLOBAL STAGE</span><h3>M-SERIES</h3></div><span class="goal-mark" aria-hidden="true">M</span></article><article class="goal"><div><span>OUR AMBITION · INTERNATIONAL COMPETITION</span><h3>TOP 3</h3></div><span class="goal-mark" aria-hidden="true">3</span></article><p class="fine-print">Future goals. Our verified results are on the <a href="/achievements/">Achievements page</a>.</p></div></div></section>
<style>.vision{background:var(--color-black-russian)}.vision h2{font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,64px)}.goals{display:grid;gap:16px}.goal{position:relative;background:var(--color-surface);padding:32px;min-height:160px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid #ffffff12;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}.goal:after{content:'';height:2px;position:absolute;bottom:0;left:32px;right:32px;background:var(--color-crimson);transform:scaleX(.2);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 350ms}.goal:hover:after{transform:scaleX(1)}.goal span:not(.goal-mark){font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.goal h3{font-size:46px;margin-top:10px}.goal-mark{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:108px;line-height:1;color:#ffffff05;position:absolute;right:20px;top:12px}.goals>p{font-size:11px}.goals>p a{text-decoration:underline}</style>

